  "description": "A false and hateful narrative that falsely claims the South African national flag represents a genocidal intent against white South Africans. This is a racially charged conspiracy theory that has been used to incite xenophobia and racial hatred, often by white supremacist groups or individuals promoting apartheid-era ideologies. It is not based on historical fact and is widely condemned as hate speech.",
